#: ../../source/templates_cohere.md:85
msgid "Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cohere.md:86
msgid ""
"**Serif for declaration, sans for utility**: CohereText carries the brand"
" voice at display scale — its serif terminals give headlines the "
"authority of published research. Unica77 handles everything functional "
"with Swiss-geometric neutrality."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cohere.md:87
msgid ""
"**Negative tracking at scale**: CohereText uses -1.2px to -1.44px letter-"
"spacing at 60–72px, creating dense, impactful text blocks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cohere.md:88
msgid ""
"**Single body weight**: Nearly all Unica77 usage is weight 400. Weight "
"500 appears only for small button emphasis. The system relies on size and"
" spacing, not weight contrast."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cohere.md:89
msgid ""
"**Uppercase code labels**: CohereMono uses uppercase with positive "
"letter-spacing (0.16–0.28px) for technical tags and section markers."
msgstr ""

