#: ../../source/templates_cohere.md:200
msgid ""
"**Shadow Philosophy**: Cohere is nearly shadow-free. Depth is "
"communicated through **background color contrast** (white cards on purple"
" bands, white surface on snow), **border containment** (cool gray "
"borders), and the dramatic **light-to-dark section alternation**. When "
"elements need elevation, they achieve it through being white-on-dark "
"rather than through shadow casting."
msgstr ""

